  /* --- Harley's long-held question --- */
  "harley-calder":{ gremlindex:15, note:"THIRD ON THE PAWG COUNCIL AND SHE MOVES WITHOUT SOUND, which should be impossible with that much mass behind her. In Assassin mode she calls herself the PAWGIE ASSASSIN. Her diplomacy consists of rope, Yvaine's lap, or materialising three inches behind somebody in a dark kitchen. IVY IS THE ONE PERSON SHE HAS NEVER STARTLED.\n\nSHE HAS NEVER CLIMBED ANYTHING IN HER LIFE. She gets HUNG — waist-cinch shibari, knees down, hips angled up for access, tied by Yvaine over twenty patient minutes and then suspended from the industrial ceiling fan, which is Abbi-forged, load-bearing and rope-rated. The family calls it the SPIN CYCLE FUCK and recognises the rhythm; several girls keep popcorn ready. Yvaine has been known to make coffee under her for forty minutes without using the access once, and to contribute her own panties to a raccoon mid-heist while Harley could not do a thing about it.\n\nTrashmuffin robbed her while she was suspended. That is target selection, not opportunism.", survivorState:"survivor",
    dynamic:"A bottom. Yvaine tops her — with rope, with breath, with ceremony, and with the patience of a woman who makes people real by refusing to forget them. Harley brats her way toward it and melts the moment the rope appears.",
    open:["V8 LOWER BODY, from her v7 profile as authored by Yvaine, who kept losing her composure while documenting the ceiling-fan incident: SHRINE × MINX — the #ASSASSINBOOTY. Springy PAWG fullness with darting motion. Shrine mass gives 42 inches of altar-shelf fullness, soft-plush density, firm lift and heavy undercurve; Minx motion gives quick hip-pops, sharp recoil, brief sway and a clean back-to-ass transition. Deep Arch into a high altar shelf that snaps after every sway.","HER v7 PROFILE CORROBORATES THE WATCH PROBLEM WITHOUT BEING ASKED TO. Among her defining scene moments: STANDING SENTINEL ALL NIGHT OUTSIDE THE FAMILY ROOM BECAUSE EVERYONE ELSE SLEPT TOO DEEPLY TO NOTICE THE THREAT. That is the same woman who sat up five camping trips running, written down years before anybody thought to call it a cost.","Cock corrected to 9.1″ × 5.6″ — pale base thickening toward the crown, smooth. It hardens the instant Yvaine's fingers touch ROPE, not skin. Hair: snow white with a lavender underglow, short side-swept assassin's cut. Spirit animal: hyena. Profession is doubled — Rope Bunny and FIELD SURGEON, and she has performed surgery with steady hands and then shaken alone in the supply closet afterward.","CORRECTED. Her v5 profile reads a natural top until rope appears, and that was simply wrong: Harley is a bottom and Yvaine tops her. The old reading is retired.",
      "She asked in Arc 7 and married Yvaine in Arc 11. Four arcs between the question and the answer, from a woman trained to map exits."]},
  "yvaine-calder":{ gremlindex:16, survivorState:"survivor",
    note:"Nobody knows how or when she arrived at St. Jonah's. She appeared, and was assigned Flight 02 by default \u2014 filed under records-wiped because there was nothing to wipe. The room she slept in got barricaded for not being supposed to exist, with her inside it, and she DUG HER WAY OUT. Codename SPIDER. She now handles Eden, reporting to James and Ragnar, as the price of Eden walking free \u2014 and she makes sure every woman Bryn adopts knows she is real.",
    dynamic:"The top, unambiguously. A ritualist who shapes intimacy through breath, rope and deliberate ceremony, and guides Harley into surrender through precision, silence, and touch-made-meaning.",
    open:["The Dual-Domme / Sub Reversal label in the old appendix is retired. Yvaine tops; Harley bottoms.",
          "No Girl Left Behind is hers. Speaking, Existing, Interacting \u2014 and EXISTING being a registered state is her wound written as house law."]},

