  "violet-bennet":{ gremlindex:12, survivorState:"civilian" },
  "sage-hawthorne":{ gremlindex:29, note:"WILDWOOD HEARTH EXISTS BECAUSE SHE KEPT VISITING. She came for Ivy first — flowers, gardens, two women who speak the same botanical language — then started bringing Zephi, and weekends turned into stays until somebody said out loud that they needed somewhere to land that wasn't the couch. The whole family built it: Bryn on the framing, Bella on the plumbing, Abbi on the hinges, Evie threading the electrical. AND SAGE NAMED IT. She named the house that exists because of her, and she named it Hearth.", survivorState:"civilian" },
  "izzy-harlow":{ gremlindex:27, survivorState:"civilian",
    note:"IDENTICAL, AND THE ARCHIVE MEANS IT. 5'11\", 38-24-40, D-cups, PLIANT GRAB-READY BUBBLE, 8.9\" \u2014 and every one of those numbers is Fiona's too, to the decimal, because the universe affirmed them ON THE SAME NIGHT and matched them rather than approximating twice. Same face, same eyes, same brat, SAME VOICE, which is the part that unsettles people who did not grow up with it.\n\nTHE ONLY TELL IS THE HAIR. IZZY IS COPPER RED WITH SNOW WHITE STREAKS; Fiona is the inverse. Both shoulder-length with the sides cut to the jaw. That is the entire difference between two human beings and they are aware of it and they use it.\n\nOLDEST BY BIRTH, WHICH GOT HER DIBS, and Fiona let her have it \u2014 then one topped one day and the other the next, and it has run that way ever since.",
    open:["5'11\" places her exactly on the JUNOESQUE floor under the proposed Stature scale, with Fiona on it too. The narrowest band entry in the canon, and both twins sit on the same inch."]},
  "fiona-harlow":{ gremlindex:28, survivorState:"civilian",
    note:"IDENTICAL TO IZZY TO THE DECIMAL \u2014 5'11\", 38-24-40, D-cups, Pliant Grab-Ready Bubble, 8.9\", same face, same eyes, SAME VOICE. Affirmed on the same night by the same intervention, which matched them rather than approximating twice.\n\nFIONA IS SNOW WHITE WITH COPPER RED STREAKS \u2014 the inverse of her sister, and the only reliable way to tell them apart at a distance.\n\nSHE IS THE ONE WHO SANG IN THE STREET FOR MONEY through the hotel-room years, and the one who claimed Izzy louder when blood rejected them both."},
